      <h1 class="jr-h1">Do Calcium Supplements Work for Bones?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">A calcium tablet is the first thing most people are handed when a bone scan looks borderline, and in 2026 the largest review of the evidence found it does very little for fractures in healthy adults. The honest answer depends almost entirely on what you already eat.</p>

